  "response": {
    "text": "This procedure advances the anti-rollback floor only on inactive spectrometer `QW-71F`. It does not alter active spectrometer `QW-88K`.\n\n1. Before continuing, confirm that work permit `FUSE-7319` is approved, `QW-71F` is disconnected from acquisition, and the Calder Fuse Station shows **Interlock Closed**.\n2. Run `calderctl wafer inspect QW-71F --bank ember-6`. Continue only if it returns `leases=0 floor=v11.2 target=v12.6`.\n\nWARNING: The next command permanently seals the firmware floor at `v12.6`. The spectrometer can never load firmware below `v12.6`, and a factory reset cannot lower the floor.\n\n3. Run:\n\n```bash\ncalderctl wafer seal QW-71F --bank ember-6 --floor v12.6 --permit FUSE-7319\n```\n\n4. Run `calderctl wafer attest QW-71F --bank ember-6`.\n5. Confirm that it returns `floor=v12.6 fuse=sealed`.",
